# Frontend quality gates

Source: `Rules/FRONTEND_PRODUCTION_ENGINEERING_RULES.md` §§23–24.

Required scripts in `Frontend/`:
- `lint` — ESLint with zero warnings; `max-lines` 300
- `check:lines` — portable ≤300 physical-line check
- `typecheck` — TypeScript (`tsc --noEmit`, generate types if needed)
- `build` — production Next.js build
- `verify` — run applicable checks and fail fast

Do not disable type/lint/security checks to force green. Do not claim verify passed unless commands actually ran.
